00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,435
The lamp.

3
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:11,238
Had you descended from the Peekquad's triworks to the Peekquad's folk where

4
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:15,795
the offduty watch were sleeping, for one single moment, you would have almost

5
00:00:15,796 --> 00:00:20,198
thought you were standing in some illuminated shrine of canonized kings

6
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:26,039
and counselors. There they lay in their triangular oaken vaults, each mariner a

7
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:32,039
chiseled mutiness, a score of lamps flashing upon his hooded eyes. In

8
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:37,634
merchant men, oil for the sailor is more scarce than the milk of queens, to dress

9
00:00:37,635 --> 00:00:42,435
in the dark, to eat in the dark and stumble in darkness to his pallet. This

